# SmartDoc AI Suite

SmartDoc AI is an intelligent document analysis platform
built using Python, LangChain and Groq AI.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- LangChain
- Groq AI (LLaMA3)
- Streamlit
- PromptTemplate
- LangChain Chains

## Module 6 - Translator + Tone Changer

Translator is a simple web application built
using Python, LangChain and Groq AI. This project
helps users translate any text to multiple languages
and change the tone of text automatically using
Artificial Intelligence.

## Features
- AI-powered Text Translation
- Support 10 Languages
- Tone Change Feature
- Formal, Casual, Professional Tones
- Translate + Tone Change Together
- Fast Response using Groq AI
- Simple and Interactive Interface
- Beginner-friendly Structure

## Project Modules

### Module 6 - Translator + Tone Changer
- Enter any text
- Select target language
- Select tone style
- AI translates and changes tone

## Installation
pip install -r requirements.txt

## Run
cd module6_translator
streamlit run streamlit_app.py
